        "slc_41885b86c82c4aa4ba4ffdd88219d792b8407c482380146b756bf6af1032335f"
      ],
      "text": "KanVibe is a keyboard-first Kanban workspace for AI coding agents that tracks branch-based tasks on a real-time board and opens each task's tmux/zellij session in browser or desktop app."
    },
