          "line_end": 171,
          "line_start": 168,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rookedsysc/kanvibe",
          "url": "https://github.com/rookedsysc/kanvibe/blob/05b9c147299aea8f2b6159f4305a19057382af15/README.md#L168-L171"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2112c1ed5a0461ea01557ffc07b639ec24c42ad9ea6edbb6d96bf93da185cb42"
      ],
      "text": "Creating a task with a branch name automatically creates a git worktree, spawns a tmux window or zellij tab, and links the terminal session to the task."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1ad4b9c42679f4ec3450dd944ef01fbe0189930ccc40e8c30d9e1a032273b2c2",
