          "git_sha": "e32b26f28c74dc9177c251f0873fe1d459a32ead",
          "line_end": 326,
          "line_start": 326,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rookedsysc/kanvibe",
          "url": "https://github.com/rookedsysc/kanvibe/blob/05b9c147299aea8f2b6159f4305a19057382af15/README.md#L326-L326"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_bc94207bba76322d6628b0a874f59bf325d43533dd696bcea6164aeaf63866bf"
      ],
      "text": "For OpenCode, KanVibe generates a TypeScript plugin at .opencode/plugins/kanvibe-plugin.ts using the @opencode-ai/plugin SDK, handling status updates in-process rather than via shell hooks."
    },
